  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 200C.",
    "In a bowl mix flour, water, olive oil, and salt to form dough; knead until smooth; cover for 20 min.",
    "While dough rests, rehydrate dried shrimp in hot water for 10 min, then drain and chop.",
    "In a skillet, heat olive oil, sauté onion and garlic until translucent.",
    "Add chopped shrimp, tomato, cumin, oregano, paprika; cook for 5 minutes until flavors meld.",
    "Stir in a pinch of salt and a small amount of melted tempered chocolate; remove from heat.",
    "Divide dough into 12 portions, roll each into circles, place filling and fold into empanadas, sealing edges with fork.",
    "Place empanadas on a parchment-lined tray, brush tops with olive oil.",
    "Bake for 20 minutes until golden and crisp.",
    "Let cool briefly, serve with fresh lime wedges."
  ],
